                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Played it years ago and liked it. Now it got updated long after launch to keep it supported, gotta leave a review at least now.\r\n\r\nGood, party based dungeon crawling in a setting rarely seen in this genre. Wish it had more classes, but the levels (party randomized) are pretty good, with well hidded secrets. Good turn-based combat. Original, pretty deep hacking simluation (that sometimes take a bit long to execute). Play it if you like dungeon crawling and the setting looks interesting.",
